    "body": "## Summary\n\nImplements roadmap items 01 (document deliverables) + 12 (interactive spreadsheet viewer) from the UX gap roadmap. Rebased onto current main (post #599/#603/#604).\n\n## Document deliverables (#01)\n\n- Contracts: `DeckSpec` / `DocSpec` / `WorkbookSpec` (specVersion 1) with bounded parsing (slide/block/sheet caps) and versioned builders, so old artifacts are never re-rendered.\n- Daemon builders: pptxgenjs (deck layouts incl. two-column + speaker notes), docx (headings/paragraphs/bullets/tables), exceljs (named sheets, CJK names supported) writing real office files into the workspace `.ling-stack/deliverables/` directory via `POST /deliverables/build`.\n- Run-artifact registration happens when the harness tool lands (follow-up slice); the route is the substrate.\n\n## Spreadsheet viewer (#12)\n\n- Sync sheet-name extraction from the workbook zip (`fflate`) for the preview envelope — a preview never pays for a full ExcelJS parse.\n- Workspace-bound windowed route `GET /previews/spreadsheet` (path traversal rejected with 403); formulas are served for reference and **never evaluated**.\n- Web `SpreadsheetGrid`: sheet tabs, sticky headers, cell selection with coordinate + formula bar, load-more windowing so a 500k-row sheet never loads whole.\n\n## Test evidence\n\n- Daemon unit suites: builder round-trips (pptx zip structure + speaker notes slide XML, docx document.xml content incl. CJK, xlsx re-read via exceljs with CJK sheet names), spec validation, window clamping, extraction windows, API routes — 14 tests green on rebased main.\n- Playwright spec with screenshot evidence (`output/playwright/spreadsheet-viewer/`): sheet tab switching, cell selection, formula display; adjacent preview suites (local-file, artifact-preview, gen-ui) pass with no regressions.\n- Web typecheck + i18n check green (en-US/zh-CN catalogs updated).\n",
