    "body": "## Summary\n- Auto-discover project and user `.agents/skills` as review-only candidates; block unsafe/duplicate sources and isolate publication ownership.\n- Add visible scan, ignored/orphaned controls, reference metadata and explicit new-skill confirmation.\n- Document Design A and its implementation; separate local macOS packaging observations from strict formal release review.\n\n## Validation\n- Shared core/daemon/web model tests: 33 passed; desktop source projection: 118 passed; native publication/hooks: 154 passed.\n- Web typecheck, lint, i18n, browser E2E: 1 passed; screenshot captured.\n- Local macOS arm64 DMG and ZIP built; ZIP integrity, mounted DMG signature, app process launch and bundled Office resource checked.\n\nLocal installer evidence is marked release-ineligible; formal release validation remains separately gated.",
